OL,4,BFernandez dropped, Anderson scores -   
OL,5,BMan City's #327m midfield dilemma      
OL,6,GThere may have been some eyebrows      
OL,7,Graised before kick-off when Manchester 
OL,8,GCity manager Enzo Maresca decided to   
OL,9,Gdrop club record signing Enzo          
OL,10,GFernandez to the bench against Fulham. 
OL,12,FFernandez's lengthy excursions back    
OL,13,Fhome to Argentina for their two        
OL,14,Ffixtures during the international      
OL,15,Fbreak may have been a factor in        
OL,16,FMaresca's thinking when selecting his  
OL,17,Fstarting XI for this game.             
